status\nmay change frequently and is updated every 15 minutes–\nplease call 515-294-4900 for the most up-to-date status.\nTriage Status System\nReferring DVM Portal Webinars\nTo help referring veterinarians make the most of the LVMC portal, we are offering a series of webinars designed to walk through key features, answer common questions, and share best practices for submitting referrals, consults, and follow-ups.\nReferring DVM Portal Webinars\nVeterinary Hospital\nLloyd Veterinary Medical Center\nHours:\nMonday through Friday, 8 am-5 pm\nEmergency services:\n24 hours a day\nReferring DVM Login\nDirections & Map\nMake an Appointment\nHixson-Lied Small Animal Hospital\nHours of Operation:\n8 am to 5 pm\nMonday through Friday\nEmergency Services:\n24 hours a day\nContact:\n515-294-4900 (Phone)\n515-294-7520 (Fax)\nHixson-Lied Small Animal Hospital\nEquine & Farm Animal Hospital\nHours of Operation:\n8 am to 5 pm\nMonday through Friday\nEmergency Services:\n24 hours a day\nContact:\n515-294-1500 (Phone)\n515-294-5224 (Fax)\nEquine Hospital\nFarm Animal Hospital\nVeterinary Field Services\nServices include individual animal and herd health veterinary care for beef, dairy, swine, sheep, goats, and camelids (alpacas and llamas).\nEmergency Services:\n24 hours a day\nCall for more information or to schedule a visit:\n515-294-7595\nVeterinary Field Services\nFeature Stories\nAdditional Stories\nEarly Morning Artist\nFamiliar Face\nNew Faculty Spotlight: Dr. Kristen Deom\nNews\nCVM Partners with VetRec to Bring AI-Powered Documentation\nACVIM Bestows Lifetime Achievement Award to CVM’s Jergens\nNew Faculty Spotlight: Shelley Chi\nNews Archives\nReferring DVM Portal\nInformation and tutorials on navigating the LVMC Referral Portal.\nReferrals\nHixson-Lied Small Animal Hospital Video\nEquine and Farm Animal Hospital Video\nQuick Links\nMake a Gift\nCurrent Openings\nClinical Trials\nReferring DVM Login\nFacebook - Small Animal Hospital\nFacebook - Large Animal Hospital\nClients\nSmall Animal\nLarge Animal\nEquine\nServices\nVeterinarians\nClinical Trials\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nISU CVM\nNews\nCVM Directory\nContacts\nGive Now\nLloyd Veterinary Medical Center\n1809 S Riverside Drive\nAmes, Iowa 50011-1134\nSmall Animal\n:\n515-294-4900\nEquine and Farm Animal\n:\n515-294-1500\nPrivacy Policy\nNon-discrimination Policy\nDigital Access and Accessibility\nConsumer Information\n© Iowa State University of Science and Technology\n2026",
